  "reviewer": "Codex - exported GLB renders and Babylon browser inspection",
  "decision": "approved",
  "views": {
    "front": "Connected moss upholstery, three distinct crowned seat cushions, attached welts and open oak slatted frame; no floating cushion or broken envelope visible.",
    "rear": "Rear support rails and continuous back remain legible; hidden zipper is intentionally concealed at normal viewing distance.",
    "underside": "Crossed support webbing, support slats and recessed fasteners remain modeled and visible from below.",
    "clay": "Rounded cushion silhouettes, rails and repeated slats read without texture; no collapsed or filled openings seen.",
    "detail": "Fine sewn line visible in browser close view, restrained cloth surface and board-aligned wood maps; no white sheen masking moss, ochre or blue tint."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "This acceptance is for a single Beta sofa pilot, not a catalog-wide realism pass.",
    "Tiny stitches and concealed zipper details are subtle at room distance.",
    "The retained wood maps do not yet provide distinct end-grain ring textures.",
    "10.64 MiB uncompressed GLB is within the pilot budget; room-scale loading on low-end mobile hardware was not benchmarked."
  ],
